{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/984089-return-of-the-ao","id":984089,"title":"Return of the Ao","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Werewolf: The Apocalypse"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-10-08T15:34:30-07:00","id":984089,"title":"Return of the Ao","content":"So, I am thinking of running a campaign about the return of the Ao, so I can run a TMNT-style campaign in WoD. Does anyone know if they ever gave stats for the Ao and, if so, where I could find them. In addition, has any actually done an campaign with Ao characters?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11683-aya-tari","name":"Aya Tari","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11683_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5986"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-08T15:49:01-07:00","id":984095,"title":"","content":"W20 Changing breeds has the stats, I was surprised with how good they ended up being!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1179-celtspz","name":"CeltSPZ","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1179_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"835"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-08T15:49:38-07:00","id":984096,"title":"","content":"And remember, just because their suchid form is a turtle doesn't mean their archid HAS to be...granted, I'm guilty....","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1179-celtspz","name":"CeltSPZ","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1179_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"835"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-08T21:47:12-07:00","id":984238,"title":"","content":"Cowabunga, dude!<br /> <br /> Sorry. I couldn't resist. But still, a group of Ao who know martial arts wrangling with a Garou pack is an image that's just too awesome for words. And martial arts Ao fighting alongside Garou who know Kailindo against the Wyrm? That would put any wuxia film to shame. :-)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/v2/125x125q90/835/7xu8.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imagizer.imageshack.us/v2/125x125q90/546/wpur.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><br /> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/folderview?id=0By9UuUWWH6CiMVlhWHMwNWcyaG8&amp;usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">Complete Garou Gifts List, Fera Gifts List, Garou Totems List and other assorted OPP/White Wolf goodies</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2710-su-tehp","name":"Su-tehp","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2710_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"532"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-08T21:55:02-07:00","id":984243,"title":"","content":"Ok I know I gave the tip that an Ao doesn't have to have a turtle like build in archid form but....is it bad I disagree with my own advice? I mean the rules don't say it has to happen but for me...its just more fun...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1179-celtspz","name":"CeltSPZ","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1179_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"835"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-08T22:02:52-07:00","id":984248,"title":"","content":"I think I would reward them for following theme. Now, they only need a Ratkin elder as their sensei...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11683-aya-tari","name":"Aya Tari","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11683_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5986"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-08T22:10:03-07:00","id":984252,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Aya Tari</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/984089-return-of-the-ao?p=984248#post984248\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I think I would reward them for following theme. Now, they only need a Ratkin elder as their sensei...</div> </div> </div> </div>While in theory, that idea would be awesome, Aya, the thing is, no Ratkin could ever be as reasonable, personable or sane as Splinter when you consider how the Ratkin are all Wyld-crazed urban terrorists that want nothing more than to tear down human civilization (at best) and/or exterminate the entire human race (at worst). Depending on the story of whether Splinter was a former human who got turned into a mutant rat-humanoid (cartoon version) or was simply a human's pet rat who got mutated alongside the TMNTs (movie version), I don't think either version of Splinter would sympathize with the Ratkin.<br /> <br /> Still an intriguing idea, though...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/v2/125x125q90/835/7xu8.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imagizer.imageshack.us/v2/125x125q90/546/wpur.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><br /> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/folderview?id=0By9UuUWWH6CiMVlhWHMwNWcyaG8&amp;usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">Complete Garou Gifts List, Fera Gifts List, Garou Totems List and other assorted OPP/White Wolf goodies</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2710-su-tehp","name":"Su-tehp","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2710_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"532"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-09T06:51:02-07:00","id":984373,"title":"","content":"Well, he could be a Munchmausen from a spirit realm where everything is a comic book version of a modern Japan, with Ninja everywhere. In that case, his insanity would just fit with the role that he adopted when he came back to the Material. I imagine though that the Rat King would be more like a Homid Ratkin, though one with unusually high standing.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11683-aya-tari","name":"Aya Tari","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11683_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5986"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-09T07:27:05-07:00","id":984383,"title":"","content":"I like the idea of a giant turtle like a biopunk living spaceship, but that is other matter.<br /> <br /> I love the feras, and I would like more to be added, but too many monster breack the gothic-punk setting. My homebrew idea is adding parrallel earths where different facts have happened, like a post-apocalipse or a prehistoric age. Werebeasts would be the guardians of those demiplanes, and they wouldn't know the demiplanes are illusory prisons for primal titans, and the djinns the prisoners/jailers (and also prisons, but they don't know or notice). Let's imagine that Pangea spirit realm being invaded by fays, risen wraiths(!?) and feras from the post-apocalipse alternate timeline... We could say it is like the White Wolf version of James Cameron's Avatar.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Tell me what you brag and I will tell you what you lack&quot; (Spanish saying)<br /> <br /> \u00abThe Master Confucius said: \u201cThe noble man is in harmony but does not follow the crowd. The inferior man follows the crowd, but is not in harmony\u201d\u00bb (Anaclet 13:23)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11152-luis-carlos","name":"Luis Carlos","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11152_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"258"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}